<LegalLayout
  title="Delete Your Account | I Like Movies"
  description="How to permanently delete your I Like Movies account and everything tied to it, from inside the app or by email."
  path="/delete-account"
  heading="Delete your account"
  updated="23 June 2026"
>
  <p>
    You can permanently delete your I Like Movies account and the data tied to it at any time.
    Deletion is immediate and cannot be undone.
  </p>

  <h2>From inside the app (fastest)</h2>
  <p>
    Open the app and go to <strong>Settings → Delete Account</strong>, then confirm. Your account
    and its data are erased right away.
  </p>

  <h2>If you can't sign in</h2>
  <p>
    Email <a href="mailto:hi@ilikemovies.app">hi@ilikemovies.app</a> from the
    address tied to your account and ask us to delete it. We'll confirm your request and remove your
    account within 30 days.
  </p>

  <h2>What gets deleted</h2>
  <p>
    Everything tied to your account: your profile, ratings, reviews, notes, lists, watchlist, friend
    connections, household membership, messages to the assistant, and any photos you uploaded.
    Residual copies in encrypted backups are removed on the normal backup rotation (within 30 days).
  </p>

  <p>See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for full details on the data we hold.</p>
</LegalLayout>
